    "description": "**Related:** WAGR-419, WAGR-97\n\n**Summary:** An SLC for PROLINE-DIRECT-ON matched the MULTI-STATE Deal (Emily, Sep 22). The multi-state naming rule is not settled, and nobody answered Kobi's Sep 9 naming proposal. WAGR-97 must regenerate the Deal Names before the first production send, so this decision blocks it.\n\n**Decide:** the region part of the Deal Name, how multi-state Deals are named and matched, and what to do with picklist values that have no CMS equivalent.\n\n**Done when:** the rule is agreed with Emily, and WAGR-97 and WAGR-419 are updated.\n\n**Sources (traceable):**\n\n* Emily, Slack 2026-09-22 (PROLINE-DIRECT-ON matched MULTI-STATE) — https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1790103141349609\n* Kobi, Slack 2026-09-09 (Deal Name convention proposal) — https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1788975617185639\n\n---\n\n_Captured 2026-09-25 by Kobi from the WagerTech calls, Slack, Jira and sandbox review (Jul–Sep 2026). Design backlog item: requirements only, not a solution._",
